{"id":"responsabilidad","lemma":"responsabilidad","pos":"noun","rank":1194,"glosses":["responsibility, responsibleness","accountability","legal liability"],"ipa":"/responsabiliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"responsabilidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-responsabilidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"La responsabilidad es mía.","en":"The responsibility is mine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1187386"},{"text":"¿Cuáles son tus responsabilidades?","en":"What are your responsibilities?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462115"},{"text":"Haz eso bajo tu propia responsabilidad.","en":"Do that at your own risk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704125"},{"text":"En la vida cotidiana tenemos muchas obligaciones y responsabilidades.","en":"In everyday life we have many obligations and responsibilities."},{"text":"Tu falta de responsabilidad me irrita.","en":"Your irresponsibility annoys me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706133"}]}